sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User/Browser
    participant Auth as Auth Blueprint
    participant DB as Database
    participant LoginMgr as Login Manager
    participant BCrypt as BCrypt

    Note over User, BCrypt: Registration Flow
    User->>Auth: Submit registration form
    Auth->>Auth: Validate form data
    Auth->>BCrypt: Generate password hash
    BCrypt-->>Auth: Return hashed password
    Auth->>DB: Create new user
    DB-->>Auth: User created
    Auth-->>User: Redirect to login

    Note over User, BCrypt: Login Flow
    User->>Auth: Submit login credentials
    Auth->>DB: Query for user by email
    DB-->>Auth: Return user (if exists)
    Auth->>BCrypt: Check password hash
    BCrypt-->>Auth: Password verification result
    Auth->>LoginMgr: Login user if credentials valid
    LoginMgr-->>Auth: User logged in
    Auth-->>User: Redirect to home page

    Note over User, LoginMgr: Protected Route Access
    User->>Auth: Access protected route
    Auth->>LoginMgr: Check if user is authenticated
    LoginMgr-->>Auth: Authentication status
    Alt user is not authenticated
        Auth-->>User: Redirect to login page
    Else user is authenticated
        Auth-->>User: Allow access to protected route
    End